  "title": "Easy Corn and Crab Chowder",
  "description": "Creamed corn and crab meat intermingle with white wine, small bits of bacon, and cubes of potatoes in this simple yet flavorful chowder.",
  "authors": [
    "R Estes"
  ],
  "date_published": "1999-06-14T18:42:53-04:00",
